---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

// English counterpart of src/pages/hr/legal.astro. When one version changes, update the other.
const pageTitle = 'Terms of Use and Business Details | Renata Horvat';
const pageDescription =
  'Business details for CreativeStar and basic information about using this website and arranging collaboration.';
const lastUpdated = '26 October 2026';
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <Header />
  <div class="py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-5xl mb-4">
          Terms of Use and Business Details
        </h1>
        <p class="text-ink-soft text-sm">
          Last updated: <span class="text-sci">{lastUpdated}</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-none">
        <div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-lg p-8 mb-8">
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed mb-0">
            This page sets out the business details of CreativeStar and basic information about using the website and arranging collaboration.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">1.</span>
            Business details
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="space-y-4 text-ink-soft">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Business name:</strong>
                <span>CreativeStar obrt za računalne usluge, vl. Renata Horvat, Zagreb, Josipa Pupačića 4</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Owner:</strong>
                <span>Renata Horvat</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Registered address:</strong>
                <span>Josipa Pupačića 4, 10090 Zagreb, Croatia</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Croatian personal identification number (OIB):</strong>
                <span>04904111520</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Register:</strong>
                <span>Croatian Crafts Register (Obrtni registar)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Craft registration number (MBO):</strong>
                <span>99173433</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
                <strong class="min-w-[200px] text-ink">Email:</strong>
                <a href="mailto:screatives.info@gmail.com" class="text-sci transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-sci-dark">
                  screatives.info@gmail.com
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">2.</span>
            Enquiries and arranging collaboration
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              On this website I present my services and selected work. Through the contact form, project questionnaire or email you can send an enquiry and describe your needs.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Submitting an enquiry does not constitute an order and does not by itself create a contract for the provision of services.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Project scope, deliverables, price, payment terms and deadlines are agreed individually and confirmed in a written quotation or contract.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Changes to the website content do not alter previously concluded contracts.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">3.</span>
            Information and prices on the website
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              I aim to keep the information on the website accurate and up to date.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Starting prices listed in Pricing refer to the described scope of service. The final price depends on the project requirements and is stated in the individual quotation.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              All prices are stated in euros. The business is not registered for VAT and does not charge VAT.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Additional work and services outside the agreed scope are arranged separately before they are carried out.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">4.</span>
            Copyright
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Unless otherwise stated, the original texts, illustrations and design of this website are the copyright works of Renata Horvat.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Client materials, logos, photographs, fonts and other third-party content belong to their respective rights holders and are used under the relevant permissions or licences.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Reuse of content requires the permission of the rights holder, except where use is allowed by law or an applicable licence.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Rights to use materials produced for a client are governed by the individual quotation or contract.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">5.</span>
            External links
          </h2>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-rule rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              The website contains links to projects and other external sites. Their operators are responsible for their content and for processing personal data.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              If you notice a broken link or believe it leads to unlawful content, you can contact me at
              <a href="mailto:screatives.info@gmail.com" class="text-sci underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-sci-dark">screatives.info@gmail.com</a>
              so that I can review it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12" aria-labelledby="complaints-heading">
          <h2 id="complaints-heading" class="mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">6.</span>
            Written consumer complaints
          </h2>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-rule bg-surface p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              You can send a written complaint:
            </p>
            <ul class="mb-4 ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-ink-soft">
              <li>
                by email to
                <a href="mailto:screatives.info@gmail.com" class="text-sci underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-sci-dark">screatives.info@gmail.com</a>;
              </li>
              <li>by post to CreativeStar, Renata Horvat, Josipa Pupačića 4, 10090 Zagreb, Croatia.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Please include a description of the issue and contact details for delivery of the reply.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              I will acknowledge receipt of the complaint without delay. I will provide a written reply within 15 days of receiving the complaint, with a clear statement of whether I accept that it is well founded.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              I keep records of written consumer complaints for one year from receipt of the complaint, in accordance with the law.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12" aria-labelledby="consumer-contracts-heading">
          <h2 id="consumer-contracts-heading" class="mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">7.</span>
            Contracting services with consumers
          </h2>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-rule bg-surface p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              If you order a service as a natural person outside your trade, business or profession, consumer rights apply.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              Before concluding a contract I will provide you with information about the service, the total price, the terms of payment and performance, and the applicable right of withdrawal. I will provide the required information and forms in a durable medium, for example by email.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              For distance contracts for services you generally have a right of withdrawal without giving reasons within 14 days of concluding the contract, subject to statutory conditions and exceptions.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              If you want performance of the service to begin before that period expires, your express request is required. If you then exercise the right of withdrawal, any obligation to pay a proportionate amount for the service already provided depends on fulfilment of the statutory conditions.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              The right of withdrawal is lost upon full performance of the service only if the statutory conditions are met, including your prior express consent and confirmation that you are aware of losing that right after full performance.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              This information does not replace the quotation, contract or notices provided for an individual project.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-3 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-ink">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-sci">8.</span>
            Governing law and statutory rights
          </h2>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-rule bg-surface p-6">
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              The business is governed by Croatian law, subject to mandatory provisions of other applicable rules, including consumer protection.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              The competent court is determined under the applicable rules on jurisdiction.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
              This text does not exclude or limit liability or rights that cannot be excluded or limited under applicable law.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
